   "text": "The ectopic-shadow heuristic labels ANY sub-0.75 α1 run that recovers within 120 s as a 'beat artifact' and excludes it plus 60 s before and 120 s after from AVG/MAX/MIN, band minutes and AT1 crossing — no RR artifact evidence is checked. Short genuine efforts (≤2-min intervals, hill surges) are therefore erased from the stats and the summary can read 'pure Zone-2 … α1 never crossed 0.75' for an interval session; the same exclusion feeds the stored workout snapshot and PDF.",
